+ * Watchdog progress counter. The console-log flush thread bumps it every
+ * ufslogsecs even when there is nothing to write, so a frozen counter means
+ * the kernel can no longer schedule that thread (or it is stuck in I/O).
+ * sweetwdt=<seconds> (0 = off) then prints a compact stack dump of the
+ * sampled processes and panics, so the dump stays on the panel to photograph.
+ */
